{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;I'M LATE!!&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've overslept! Play as a high school girl\u00a0who's late for class and facing a chaotic dash to school. In this short, 2D top-down runner, you'll need to overcome a series of ridiculous familiar anime tropes obstacles to get to class before 8 AM.<br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced, Chaotic Gameplay:</strong> A simple control scheme lets you jump right into the action  and weave through an anime-inspired chaotic world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cast of Craziness:</strong> Encounter a vibrant cast of characters including a mischievous witch, fallen idol and more, all ready to create pandemonium on your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toast of Tardiness:</strong> Don't forget your breakfast! Grab a piece of jam-covered toast to unlock a special ability that will help you overcome the most absurd challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Anime Pixel Art:</strong> Immerse yourself in a world bursting with color, brought to life through charming, easy-looking and expressive pixel art.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Witch's Bane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929050/08ef741a9f6a1552cba0f98111f97daef4b84968.jpg"},{"name":"Fallen Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929050/a593f36416a389c02cc1073763c2e553d7c311bc.jpg"},{"name":"First Bell Sprint","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929050/03a29fb5e31207e01daee2b879e71a4cb35d89f3.jpg"},{"name":"Morning Dash Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3929050/583de14f9146e5c806bbaa0956120f376d2d95c6.jpg"},{"name":"I'M LATE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/